Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:14.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of deception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Viruses have infiltrated the firewall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The infection is spreading.{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}The antibody is experiencing compatibility\Nconflict. The infection is spreading.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:52.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}The enemy has penetrated the outer firewall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:54.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Increase allocation to the peripheral defence lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:57.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Have decoys deal with the infected areas; discard them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:02:00.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Updating virus analysis: cannibalisation in progress;{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}fourteen types have been neutralised,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:02.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}two types are still active,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:03.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}and one type remains unidentified.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean, "unidentified"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Identify it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:07.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Virus is inert and unresponsive, according to preliminary analysis results.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:09.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}It is most likely a decoy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:12.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Run a diagnosis with a different version of the antibody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:14.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do not let the enemy observe our response protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The enemy has begun to assume control over the broadcast relay unit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:18.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}We are unable to physically disconnect the circuit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The virus is propagating.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn it, who are these cyber attackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:23.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The primary defence line has been reduced by 60%.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Request backup support from Poseidon's Decatoncale!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:31.10,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,{\b1}The Hope \N Named Despair{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:57.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Call an ambulance. Rescuing the injured comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get an ambulance, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:05.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're at the Niihama 3 shopping mall -\Nwe'll need at least five of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the same, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He blew himself up, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, he used plastic explosives rigged with nails and screws.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn it, what is this whole "indiscriminate\Nterrorism after a warning" thing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems like this is all about the {\i1}size{\i} of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The size of terror?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:42.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah. As is the case with the Individual Eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after first releasing a warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the terrorists end up repeating\Nindiscriminate suicide bombings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This type is troublesome; for them, the\Nsignificance of terrorism lies in the act itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:57.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then you're saying that there will be another act of terrorism?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we are to believe their warning, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:03.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn... What the hell is happening in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:06.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something's starting to go haywire, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:10.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're probably right. We can't keep up the way things are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, there's no way we can catch up the way things are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are there any hints in the warning as to \N where and when the terrorist attacks will take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:26.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As of now, the only information we have is \N an e-mail saying that five terrorist attacks involving
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,suicide bombers will occur today in Niihama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was sent to the Prefectural Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this case is the same type as the\Nattacks that occurred last week in Fukuoka,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:36.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there is no doubt that the final attack will also occur here in Niihama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:41.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Transfer jurisdiction over this attack to the Prefectural\NPolice, and prevent the next attack from occurring at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:45.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you asking us to detain every single cyborg in Niihama?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:50.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though this seems indiscriminate,\Nthere must be some pattern to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:54.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, where's the Major when we need her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:57.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She's on a classified infiltration mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:04:59.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A classified infiltration mission, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:03.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll leave this to the local police and\Nthe old man - we're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:07.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bomer, report if you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:12.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's this about human bombs in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:15.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This country is not an anarchy under enforced rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:19.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It means things are no longer so\Npeaceful that you can say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not even in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:26.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True... The refugee issue is a powder keg ready to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:33.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That the individualists have got this radical may be\Nthe fault of a government with so uncertain a course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It could be the refugees...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd totally forgotten that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:49.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief! Please look into the suspects from last week's\NFukuoka incident and the past few hours' attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:53.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their bodies are barely intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:57.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What we know is that they had a relatively high\Npercentage of cybernetic components and not much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:58.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, it's not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:03.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The IR system and surveillance cameras must have\Nrecorded them while they were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want all this footage to be collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:14.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This sort of stuff can't happen all that often on such a large scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:18.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even if people are forced by others or by their superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:25.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suicide bombing is an act of terrorism you resort to \N when you have no further hope in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, are things going all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems as though we're really behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will get to the next one without fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:56.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And how are you doing on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Tachikomas are doing fine in agent mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:02.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is almost no need to consider any loss\Nin efficiency resulting from physical distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While there will be no victory,\NI don't think there will be defeat, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:10.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't go too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:12.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll try to rein myself in, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, is the Omni-sense mask array working?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:25.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've already finished investigating the shortest route!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mask array activation is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've disabled the emergency\Nlock down mechanism in the security room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:41.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The enemy's offensive firewall consists of 512 types.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}It is being deployed in Level 1.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:43.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The defence line has been restored by 70%. Continuing struggle for 22%, 8%...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:47.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}403 types are of the destructive mobile variety.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,750,,{\i1}82 types are composite parts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:48.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,650,,{\i1}27 types are explosives and decoys.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:53.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,600,,{\i1}The backup firewall from the Decatoncale has reached an activation of 97% of maximum.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It withstood the attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:06.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you let AIs handle everything, you'll\Nget outsmarted by cats and mice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A report from the cyber police has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:12.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They have determined the individuals \N who presumably carried out suicide bombings
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,from the footage retrieved from \N locations where acts of terrorism occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are their images.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:19.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:22.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bomer, what about your analysis of the explosives?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:26.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Judging from the residue, C-4 was employed in all four cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can you profile the source or the manufacturing process used?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:34.46,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: Spring-8 is a research particle accelerator{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:34.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I were able to bring all of this into\NSpring-8, I'd be able to find out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:40.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, I got some interesting data on the\N\n stores that were destroyed by the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The first two buildings were being\Nused as gathering places for particularists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:52.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The next two were also owned by an organisation using\Nthe Refugee Special Treatment Act as a cover for profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:56.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This restaurant's background is similar to the rest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:59.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems Batou's hunch might be right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:02.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have the Prefectural Police's Public\NSafety Division figured that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:05.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No matches were found in their database.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:06.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Contact the Prefectural Police immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have their police officers patrol any\Ngathering locales for particularists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,as well as offices and shops operated by mob-related\Norganisations profiting from the Refugee Special Treatment Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:23.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If they find anyone about twenty years old\Nwho is from a refugee camp, they should
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:25.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,question them, regardless of their gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tell them to be especially careful with anyone who\Nhas a high percentage of cybernetic components.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:35.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So it {\i1}is{\i} the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:40.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hadn't expected that. I'd think the\Ncitizens would have had more issues with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:47.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why these individualists, the\NIndividual Eleven, emerged, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:50.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And now, we have another\Nbunch that snapped over them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:53.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, I guess that's one way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:58.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We should assume that the refugee\N"powder keg" has already been ignited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:03.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dying in order to send a message out...\NIt's abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:10.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What were the time intervals between\Neach of the cases, from the first to the last?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:13.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The warning was sent out exactly at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:16.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, the first attack occurred\Nthirteen minutes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:19.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The second attack occurred\Nthirty-eight minutes after the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:24.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The third attack happened after a bit of a\Nbreather, approximately two hours later at 3:23.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:28.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The fourth attack happened after\Nan even longer interval, at 7:11.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:30.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There should be a greater time\Ninterval before the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:36.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In serial suicide bombing terrorism, the ones\Nwhose resolve is firmest go first, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:40.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's hope that there's still time left\Nbefore the next suicide bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:51.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Man, you're really knowledgeable\Nabout the more extreme cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:55.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:58.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If their intent is to generate terror,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:03.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd think it'd be more effective\Nto {\i1}not{\i} have a bomb warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you think they sent it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it be that they want someone to know, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To know what their final actions were?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's as I'd expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:27.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've confirmed that they had strong\Nties with Poseidon from Gouda's history,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but to think it's all been reduced to\Na manual to this extent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:32.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A trap...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Deploy the root array along three axes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have all offensive firewalls on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Deployment complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Back me up with full functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:05.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be careful of compound viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:09.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, invest all senses\Ninto the thickest firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:22.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Inject the Chroma file into the\Nsystem before the enemy arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Set up an advanced combat formation\Nwith all eight arrays.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All homing mines that are equipped\Nwith the virus array are now active!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suppression of all twelve\NSAT-MAN cyberbrains complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good. Perform a final safety\Ncheck on the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:51.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Confirmed activation of the action control\Nvirus that was injected into the cyberbrains
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:52.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of forty-five security department staff members.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:54.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Full range of offensive\Nfirewalls is also operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is no conflict between their functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:59.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good. Our time expires when they discover the\Nfreeze on the security department staff members.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:02.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You will monitor the forty-five cyberbrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we're discovered, notify me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:06.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is something wrong, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:15.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, there's nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:34.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, this is the Decatoncale\NI've always heard rumours about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems to have constructed a virtual persona from\Nvast amounts of data and is running a simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am Gouda Kazundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:51.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have previously been involved with the radioactive\Ndust removal and molecular engineering robotics
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,projects at Dai-Nippon Giken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:56.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Radioactive dust removal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He must be referring to the Japanese Miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:13:59.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As a technician?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:01.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:04.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My brain is specialised in linguistic ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After the two world wars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this country was able to regain its status\Nas an economic power after implementing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:15.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the radioactive dust removal method,\Nwhich was developed under my direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was also supposed to join the uppermost\Nechelons of society at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:26.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, just as this country was unable to gain a\Nsignificant foothold in the international community,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:31.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was unable to acquire a\Nsignificant status in the social system here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:37.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You mean, society did not provide concrete\Nrecognition to the individual who was all talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:46.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I discovered long ago that this society\Nsuffers from a fatal structural defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:48.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The mutation of information that\Nshould not mutate in principle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:56.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the illusory originality called individuality
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:15:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,can easily trigger synchronisation\Nin the current societal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have named this\N"An Act of Creation in the Name of Consumption."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:10.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds like a conclusion an individual\Nwho withdrew into the net would reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Stand Alone Complex?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:17.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fortunately, I had an extremely\Nstrong tolerance for solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:22.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, it took me a very long time to realise
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:33.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the very attributes I was born with were making the system\Nwithhold proper recognition for the impact I made on society.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.17,0:15:36.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In other words, you had an inferiority complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No. My very existence was problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:49.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Personas that are desired by the system itself\Ndefinitely exist in society, and people hunger for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:53.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And yet, they are almost\Nsinfully unaware of this fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you satisfied with who you are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Far more than I expected I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you know that the ghost, whose existence,\Nunlike the body's, is only confirmed paradoxically,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,actually changes in accordance\Nwith changes to the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:18.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Although, there was apparently some theorist who saw a\Npersonal raison d'etre in revolutions and carried one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:20.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Patrick Sylvestre, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have committed myself to his theories before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:29.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I admired heroes and truly wanted to have charisma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am someone who should be leading others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:37.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That thought has existed within\Nme as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:41.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In the end, my body prevented\Nme from achieving that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, fate was on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:49.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My body was transformed by an accident that left me\Nwandering the line between life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then my ghost happened to change as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:57.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just as the thinker acquired a mission by\Nencountering a revolution, I also acquired a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:03.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A mission to restructure\Nthe system called the State.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An advocate of national reorganisation,\Nor a megalomaniac?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:16.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right now, what this nation desires is to recreate a state\Nof Xanadu that can only exist by consuming another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By accident, this nation has\Nrealised this in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:26.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Those without a motive continue\Nto desire this, unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:29.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I merely provide them with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:31.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And then you'll become a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:35.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I no longer wish for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:39.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My role is to produce the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:45.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To create an activist who will voice and carry out\Nwhat those without a motive yearn for,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:49.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,yet cannot say out loud themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:55.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, this Xanadu at the end of consumption -\Nyou mean Japan under the Cold War?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:18:02.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If so, then who is this hero\Nyou are saying you will produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Individual Eleven?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:30.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, contact the security department.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A cyber attacker has infiltrated the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They took more time than I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, they discovered our infiltration!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:49.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, are the enemies of this\N"hero" you speak of the refugees?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:54.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By making them imagined enemies,\Nyou manipulate the citizens' thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:55.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thought manipulation is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At times, the law must be bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The end justifies the means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:07.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is a philosophy that applies to\Nterrorists and democratic states alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:09.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're saying that expelling the\Nrefugees is a national consensus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:12.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Modesty is one of our people's virtues.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:13.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:18.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Last question. What do you think about Section 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 9... let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:26.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The chain reaction of hatred that\Nwas created by absence will not stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:33.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 9 will suffer in between the national consensus\Nof the people and their own sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, you will be in danger\Nif you don't drop soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:37.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've just arrived at Gate No. 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:55.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When the local police questioned the individual,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:58.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the terrorist apparently ran into the\Nsubway and threatened to detonate herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I managed to get the train stopped, but it\Nhas entered the station with passengers inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop her, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:08.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:12.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've found the terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As we'd expected, she's a refugee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:22.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.19,0:20:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, don't make any moves.\NPut your hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:34.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right. We won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Slowly, now... stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:53.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:01.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:02.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:12.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:23.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since she has explosives packed inside of\Nher gut, she'll need to be in total isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:24.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:43.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Security section!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:44.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Check inside the building immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:47.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The cyber attacker appears to have\Ninfiltrated the premises in person, using a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What were the security staff doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Restart the SAT-MAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:58.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Check the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Once you restart the firewall array,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:03.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,transfer jurisdiction to Poseidon\Nand let them handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:05.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The attacker will not come here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, we managed to get the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.07,0:22:16.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This will have lasting effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a declaration of war from the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.63,0:22:28.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou's hunch is, unfortunately, correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.03,0:22:34.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Individual Eleven are most probably\Nindividualists that were "produced" by Gouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their goal is a refugee uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:42.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The compromise will probably be to create an\Nautonomous region for the refugees within this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.27,0:22:47.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Up to now, we have suffered total defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.47,0:22:52.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The "chain reaction of hatred"\NGouda spoke of has definitely begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:11.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.06,0:23:16.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:18.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.86,0:23:22.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:26.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:29.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:34.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:37.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:38.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:38.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.95,0:23:40.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:41.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:42.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.13,0:23:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:45.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:47.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:50.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.71,0:23:51.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
